  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.20\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.20 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.19\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.19 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.18\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.18 release.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.17\n- Synchronized package version with the preview.17 release.\n- Initial release.\n- [JSImport]-based IndexedDB and localStorage persistence for Remote Config containers, settings, and metadata.\n- CORS-safe Remote Config request header interceptor.\n- Tab-visibility lifecycle monitor for the realtime stream.\n- Framework-independent WASM (Uno Platform, Avalonia WASM, pure .NET WASM).\n- IndexedDB-primary store with localStorage fallback when IndexedDB is unavailable or security-blocked.\n- Chains Installations.Browser.UseBrowser() when the installation store is the in-memory default.",
